  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日の仕事はハードだったけど\r\n疲れていないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ぜーんぜん、疲れてないよっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？\r\nなら、いいんだけどな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、プロデューサーさんと一緒だと\r\n甘奈はずっとニコニコでいられるんだ☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん\r\n甘奈のこと、大切にしてくれてるもん！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "今日なんて\r\nお仕事終わった後まで付き合ってくれてるし……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ショッピングくらいなら、俺はいつでも大丈夫だぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもなぁ……甘奈はもう人気アイドルなんだ\r\nこんな人通りの多いところにいて大丈夫か？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だいじょーぶ！\r\n堂々としてたら意外とバレないんだよ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それに、息抜きは必要でしょ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たしかに息抜きは必要だな\r\n最近の甘奈はすごくがんばってくれてるし",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんにそう言ってもらえると、\r\n甘奈も嬉しいな！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近は仕事が増えて忙しいのに、\r\n甘奈は楽しそうにしてくれて助かるよ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ううん、ホントに心の底から楽しいんだ！\r\n甘奈、プロデューサーさんの前で無理はしないもん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、いろいろと気持ちの変化があったもんな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルとしてどんどん成長してるのを感じるよ\r\nプロデューサーとして、すごくうれしい",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "やだなぁ～褒めすぎだよ～\r\nえへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし！　普段、頑張ってくれてるお礼だ\r\n今日はとことん付き合うぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで何を買うんだ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "雑誌で見かけためっちゃ気になる服があるんだー\r\n今日はそれが見たいかなって",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "行きたい店はもう決まっているのか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "もち！\r\nこっちだよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110110"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 240
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "se": "0117",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "bg": "00010",
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "じゃーん！　このお店だよー☆",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ほらほら、ショーウィンドーに出てるの\r\nめっちゃ似合うと思うんだよね～☆",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、でもこの店って……",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "メンズの服屋じゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、びっくりした？\r\n今日はプロデューサーさんの服を一緒に見たかったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、この服見て\r\nぜったい、似合うと思う！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ね、どうかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうって……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんってさ、いつもスーツばっかりだけど\r\nけっこー元はいいと思うんだよねー",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だから甘奈、\r\nプロデューサーさんのいろーんな姿、見てみたいな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……\r\nそんなこと言われても、どうもなぁ……",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ダメ、いつもお世話になってるんだから、\r\nたまには甘奈からお礼させて！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、でもなんか悪いような",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そんなことないよ。だってこれは甘奈のわがまま……\r\n今日のプロデューサーさんは、それを聞く側だもん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それに、今日はとことん付き合うって言ってくれたのは\r\nどこの誰だったかな～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……う、うん。そうだな、わかった！\r\n今日は甘奈に全部任せよう！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "やった！　きーまりっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "じゃあ、シャツはあれでパンツはあれ\r\nシューズもいいのがありそう……お、あの帽子もありかも？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そんなにたくさんか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "もっちろん！　だって、色々考えてたんだもんね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110250,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "今日はプロデューサーさんを甘奈の好みに\r\nプロデュースしちゃうよ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003110260,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、だから覚悟しててね☆\r\nプロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400311/2014003110260"
  },
